Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 18:02:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Run an external Cpp2IL CLI when present; use local
 Il2CppInterop 1.5.4-moonsweepers.2

Cpp2IL builds that read IL2CPP metadata v107+ (Unity 6000.5+) are built against
AsmResolver 6.0.x, while Il2CppInterop 1.5.x needs 6.0.0-beta.5, so they cannot share
a process. BepInEx/cpp2il/Cpp2IL.exe, when present, runs out of process and its dummy
assemblies are read from disk.
---
 .../BepInEx.Unity.IL2CPP.csproj               |  6 +-
 .../Il2CppInteropManager.cs                   | 90 +++++++++++++++++++
 nuget.config                                  |  1 +
 3 files changed, 94 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Runtimes/Unity/BepInEx.Unity.IL2CPP/BepInEx.Unity.IL2CPP.csproj b/Runtimes/Unity/BepInEx.Unity.IL2CPP/BepInEx.Unity.IL2CPP.csproj
